Z||000002||ThatRickGuy||09-08-2000||02:31 PM||||Well, I'm a complete moron beacuse I paid more then that for my '88 formula w/ T-Tops... a good chunk more. only to drive it for a few days to hear that ever so wonderful knocking noise  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> I'm to embarrased to say what I paid for it, but I swear there was no knock when I got it. Engine was rebuild at 50k and was then at 80k. Now, tag on a $1700 overhaul (3.2 conversion) because 1 rod was almost welded on, and the 5 others were glassed over and one of the valves had cracked, I didn't even get to beat on it!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> but any ways, if I had paid $2200 and the 3.2 rebuild, I'd be at about the same place as just buying the car. so to me, $2200 sounds good. (except it's not a T-Top)||||reg||1
